---
import { getEntry } from 'astro:content';
const vice = await getEntry('blog', 'vice-city-vices-bad-habits-and-breaking-both');
const autopilot = await getEntry('blog', 'who-s-driving-autopilot');
if (!vice || !autopilot) throw new Error('Featured newsletter issues are missing.');
const { Content: ViceContent } = await vice.render();
const { Content: AutopilotContent } = await autopilot.render();
---
<div class="newsletter-landing">
<header class="hero" id="subscribe"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="hero-grid"><div><p class="eyebrow">The Modern Compass Newsletter</p><h1>Look one<br><span>layer deeper.</span></h1><p class="hero-prose">Practical perspectives to help you see what’s beneath the surface before deciding what comes next.</p>
    <form class="signup-card" id="subscribeForm" action="/api/subscribe" method="post"><div class="honeypot"><label for="website">Leave this field blank</label><input id="website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off"></div><label for="newsletter-email">Your email address</label><div class="signup-row"><input id="newsletter-email" name="email" type="email" placeholder="you@example.com" required autocomplete="email"><button type="submit">Subscribe free</button></div><p class="signup-detail">Every third Friday. Free to read. Unsubscribe anytime.</p><div class="reader-proof"><p>Join 150+ readers across email and LinkedIn—founders, leaders, professionals, parents, and more.</p><p>Including readers at Google Cloud, Confluent, and SailPoint.</p></div><p class="preview-status" hidden role="alert"></p></form>
  </div><div class="phone-stage"><div class="iphone" aria-label="iPhone preview of the actual Vice City newsletter"><div class="screen"><div class="status"><span>9:41</span><span class="island"></span><span class="status-icons">▴▴ ▰</span></div><div class="screen-scroll"><img class="newsletter-capture" src="/newsletter/vice-city-newsletter-capture.jpg" alt="Screenshot of Vice City: Vices, Bad Habits, and Breaking Both from the Modern Compass newsletter"></div><div class="home"></div></div></div><button class="phone-control" type="button" aria-pressed="false">Pause newsletter preview Ⅱ</button></div></div>
</div></header>

<section class="benefits-section" id="what-you-get"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">What you’ll get</p><h2 class="section-title">Every third Friday, you’ll receive:</h2><div class="benefits">
  <article class="benefit"><span class="number">1</span><div><h3>One topic from everyday life</h3><p>A habit you want to change, a relationship on autopilot, or something you haven’t quite gotten unstuck in.</p></div></article>
  <article class="benefit"><span class="number">2</span><div><h3>Look a layer deeper</h3><p>We dig into the why behind it and look at it a different way.</p></div></article>
  <article class="benefit"><span class="number">3</span><div><h3>Real examples from real life</h3><p>Ranging from stories from my own life, experiences from others, or practical research that helps connect some dots.</p></div></article>
  <article class="benefit"><span class="number">4</span><div><h3>Something to try for yourself</h3><p>At least one practical idea you can try in your own life to see what works for you.</p></div></article>
</div></div></section>
<section class="note-section" id="note-from-josh"><div class="wrap"><div class="paper"><img class="headshot" src="/1645116024072.jpeg" alt="Josh Imholte"><div><h2 class="note-label">Note from Josh</h2><p>I’ve spent more than a decade working through ambiguous problems professionally, where finding a way forward means looking beneath the surface. It took me years to recognize that in my own life, for a long time I was trying to fix what I could see without understanding what was underneath. Modern Compass grew from that experience.</p></div></div></div></section>
<section class="top-section" id="top-issues"><div class="wrap"><div class="top-heading"><div><p class="eyebrow">A place to start</p><h2 class="section-title">Top issues</h2></div><p>Two personal favorites, chosen by Josh.</p></div><div class="issues">
  <a class="issue" data-article="vice-city" aria-haspopup="dialog" href="https://newsletter.themoderncompass.io/p/vice-city-vices-bad-habits-and-breaking-both"><img src="/newsletter/vice-city-thumbnail.avif" alt="Vice City newsletter artwork" loading="lazy"><div class="issue-body"><span class="issue-tag">Habits · Self control</span><h3>Vice City: Vices, Bad Habits, and Breaking Both</h3><p>Choosing a focus area, finding the why beneath it, and changing the patterns that keep pulling you back.</p><span class="read">Read the newsletter →</span></div></a>
  <a class="issue" data-article="autopilot" aria-haspopup="dialog" href="https://newsletter.themoderncompass.io/p/who-s-driving-autopilot"><img src="/blog-thumbnails/who-s-driving-autopilot.svg" alt="Who’s driving autopilot newsletter illustration" loading="lazy"><div class="issue-body"><span class="issue-tag">Relationships · Connection</span><h3>Who's driving...autopilot?</h3><p>A summer with my daughter, and four ways to reconnect when a relationship starts running on autopilot.</p><span class="read">Read the newsletter →</span></div></a>
</div></div></section>

<template id="article-vice-city"><h2 class="reader-title" id="reader-title">{vice.data.title}</h2><img src="/newsletter/vice-city-thumbnail.avif" alt="Vice City newsletter artwork" /><ViceContent /></template>
<template id="article-autopilot"><h2 class="reader-title" id="reader-title">{autopilot.data.title}</h2><AutopilotContent /></template>
</div>
